        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur FAVCGR-ONE, Fifth Avenue C Grip Entry Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Fifth Avenue Handleset with C Grip exhibits a stunning example of modern silhouettes while still holding on to traditional charm. This handleset is rectangular in shape and displays an elegant classic grip for maximum style. The Fifth Avenue C Grip Entry Set is available in single cylinder and dummy functions. Select your favorite finish color and interior trim knob or lever for an end look that is 100 percent you. The One-Piece Fifth Avenue Handleset is ideal for larger doors due to its long length. It will fit most pre-drilled doors that are 1-3/4 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick and have 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-fifth-avenue-series\"><b>Fifth Avenue Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Large Fifth Avenue Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits most pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Ideal for doors that are 84 inches or taller.</li>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 5th Avenue C Grip Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Height: 19\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Throw: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-FAVCONE-specifications.pdf?v=1704262362\" target=\"new\"><b>Fifth Avenue C-Grip Handleset Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the interior, the lever operates the latch and a thumbturn operates the deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Handleset:</b> This handleset is does not function--neither locking nor latching.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nInside trim levers are handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to determine left or right handed.</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Fifth Avenue Handleset with C Grip",
